title: 'pallet-assets: migrate native-token deposits from Currency reserves to fungible
  holds'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Migrates `pallet-assets` off the deprecated `ReservableCurrency` trait for the native-token deposits it takes (asset-creation, asset-account, metadata, and approval deposits). Those deposits are now taken as `fungible` holds under `HoldReason::Deposit`.
    Part of #12399 / #226.
